From 7e92ec650ec2492e0922880f424dd9e752c9a402 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 06:56:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2 (cont.): owner-draw event args, hit-test info,
 DataObject, more enums

Continues GAP-CLOSURE-PLAN.md Phase 2 with additive, compile-compat types
(no re-parenting), all verified against the net48 reference assembly.

Owner-draw + hit-testing (unblocks custom-drawn ListView/TreeView):
- DrawListViewItemEventArgs, DrawListViewSubItemEventArgs,
  DrawListViewColumnHeaderEventArgs, DrawTreeNodeEventArgs and their handlers.
  Constructor signatures/parameter order taken from the reference assembly; the
  Draw* helpers use the existing TextRenderer/ControlPaint/Graphics.
- ListViewHitTestInfo, TreeViewHitTestInfo.

Top-level DataObject:
- System.Windows.Forms.DataObject : IDataObject, an in-memory format->object store
  (SetData/GetData/GetDataPresent/GetFormats + Text/Image/FileDropList helpers).
  Coexists with the clipboard-backed Clipboard.DataObject; internal Clipboard use
  is unaffected (nested type wins in that scope).

19 more compatibility enums with values from the reference assembly (several
[Flags] or non-sequential/negative): RichTextBox{StreamType,ScrollBars,Finds,
SelectionAttribute,SelectionTypes,WordPunctuations,LanguageOptions},
TreeViewDrawMode, ToolStrip{DropDownCloseReason,GripDisplayStyle,ManagerRenderMode},
DataGridViewAutoSizeColumnsMode, AutoCompleteSource, ArrangeDirection,
ArrangeStartingPosition, CaptionButton, MenuGlyph,
{ListView,TreeView}HitTestLocations.

Net48 public types present 522->568 (missing 512->466 across both patches). Full
suite green at 2294 (+33 new GTK-free functional tests: enum values, event-arg
constructor round-trips, DataObject store semantics).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
